FORD, STRENGTH 58. SEEN: RHINO FIRST FOOT, RHINO BOWMEN.","cipher":null},{"seq":1438,"t":8100,"type":"model","house":"rhino","model":"local:local","tokens":1765,"retries":0},{"seq":1439,"t":8100,"type":"thought","house":"rhino","text":"War is ending. Need to secure a ford or take a camp. My infantry/archery are at F2/NBM (2w old). Orchid has been active. Tiger has troops near F2. I'll move my infantry to F2 to secure it, adhering to doctrine (middle ford hold). I'll use a cipher move to maintain security."},{"seq":1440,"t":8100,"type":"courier","id":"c445","house":"rhino","letter":"L536","kind":"order","to":"rhino-inf-1","path":["rhino-camp","north-village","n-mid","F2"],"depart":8400,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, MARCH TO MIDDLE FORD.","cipher":"BEQRT BKKT, IMQND TK IESSHA BKQS."},{"seq":1441,"t":8100,"type":"model","house":"kite","model":"local:local","tokens":3961,"retries":1},{"seq":1442,"t":8100,"type":"thought","house":"kite","text":"Watch 28. Doctrine: Speed wins, plain orders by road, horse hunts north, take East Ford early and hold it. Kite infantry/archery are at F3 (East Ford) (2w ago). Rhino/Orchid/Tiger have presence at F2/F3. I must reinforce F3 and press the advantage. Use cav to screen/move towards "},{"seq":1443,"t":8100,"type":"courier","id":"c446","house":"kite","letter":"L537","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-1","path":["kite-camp","n-east","F3"],"depart":8100,"plain":"FIRST FOOT, HOLD AT EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1444,"t":8100,"type":"courier","id":"c447","house":"kite","letter":"L538","kind":"order","to":"kite-inf-2","path":["kite-camp","n-east","F3"],"depart":8100,"plain":"SECOND FOOT, HOLD AT EAST FORD.","cipher":null},{"seq":1445,"t":8100,"type":"courier","id":"c448","house":"kite","letter":"L539","kind":"order","to":"kite-cav-1","path":["kite-camp"],"depart":8100,"plain":"HORSE, MARCH TO NORTH BANK WEST.","cipher":null},{"seq":1446,"t":8100,"type":"model","house":"orchid","model":"local:local","tokens":1989,"retries":0},{"seq":1447,"t":8100,"ty